[en.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_FOLLOW_UP]
Investigate the Jailbreak

[en.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_FOLLOW_UP_desc]
In the heavily guarded Peaks of Peril prison at the capital of our commune, the mastermind of the “Blossom Case” successfully escaped from prison and disappeared without a trace after just one month of imprisonment. Is there a bigger mastermind boss behind the scenes? Or is there a mole inside the prison?

[zh.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_FOLLOW_UP]
调查越狱事件

[zh.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_FOLLOW_UP_desc]
在守卫森严的险崇峰监狱，麒麟社群的首都，“繁花案”主谋竟然在入狱后一个月就成功越狱并且消失得无影无踪。难道还有更大的主使者在背后操纵？还是监狱内部存在内鬼？
